  "description": "API probe P22-B, layer stack (phase1.24 item 3.4, decision 296): on the plane, a group holding two fills, and a fill above it with a black mask (a uniform mask fill effect) and a levels effect under a uniform content fill effect; in the first session and after save/reopen: Node.get_parent, get_next_sibling, get_previous_sibling and get_texture_set; isinstance of layerstack.EffectNode on every node; LayerNode.instances of a layer without instances; GroupLayerNode.set_collapsed and is_collapsed; FillLayerNode and FillEffectNode is_symmetry_enabled, before and after a Triplanar projection and FillEffectNode.set_symmetry_enabled (on the content effect and on the mask effect); FillLayerNode and FillEffectNode get_material_source in split mode and in the mask context; FillEffectNode.reset_source on a channel and in the mask context, read back; ProjectionMode.Fill; FilteringMode BilinearHQ, BilinearSharp and Nearest read back; get_selected_nodes, set_selected_nodes (layers, then effects), set_selection_type with every SelectionType member and get_selection_type; a ScopedModification holding a rename, an opacity edit and the selection calls its documentation says raise inside it.",
